### 1. Utilization Monitoring APIs
### Start Equipment Utilization
POST http://localhost:8080/api/utilization/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipmentId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "purpose": "AI Model Training Lab Work"
}

### End Equipment Utilization
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/utilization/end/1

### Get All Utilization Logs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/utilization

### Get Utilization Log by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/utilization/1

### Get Utilization by Equipment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/utilization/equipment/1

### Get Utilization by Department
GET http://localhost:8080/api/utilization/department/Computer%20Science

### Get Overall Utilization Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/utilization/overall

### Get Top Used Equipment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/utilization/top-used


### 2. Dashboard Statistics APIs
### Get Dashboard Overview Stats Map
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/stats

### Get Utilization Dashboard DTO
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/utilization

### Get Full Dashboard Response DTO
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/response


### 3. Inter-Institution Resource Sharing APIs
### Share Equipment Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource-sharing/share
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedById": 1,
  "equipmentId": 1,
  "sourceLaboratoryId": 1,
  "targetLaboratoryId": 2,
  "startDate": "2026-08-10",
  "endDate": "2026-08-15",
  "purpose": "Joint Research Project"
}

### View Shared Equipment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource-sharing/shared

### Approve Resource Share Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/resource-sharing/1/approve

### Reject Resource Share Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/resource-sharing/1/reject


### 4. External Booking APIs
### Book Shared Equipment (External Institution User)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/external-bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalInstitutionName": "MIT Partner Lab",
  "externalUserEmail": "external.researcher@mit.edu",
  "externalUserName": "Dr. Sarah Connor",
  "equipmentId": 1,
  "bookingDate": "2026-08-20",
  "returnDate": "2026-08-25",
  "purpose": "Spectroscopy Testing"
}

### View All External Bookings (Booking History)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/external-bookings/history?email=external.researcher@mit.edu

### Get External Booking by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/external-bookings/1

### Cancel External Booking
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/external-bookings/1/cancel


### 5. Waitlist Management APIs
### Join Waitlist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/waitlist/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-05",
  "priority": 1
}

### Get Waitlist by Equipment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/waitlist/equipment/1

### Get User Waitlist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/waitlist/user/1

### Leave Waitlist
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/waitlist/leave/1


### 6. Booking Optimization APIs
### Suggest Next Available Slot
GET http://localhost:8080/api/booking-optimization/next-slot/1?durationDays=3

### Suggest Alternative Equipment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/booking-optimization/alternatives/1

### Check / Prevent Overlapping Bookings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/booking-optimization/check-overlap?equipmentId=1&startDate=2026-08-20&endDate=2026-08-25